{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/LetToHave.html#Lean.Meta.letToHave\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">letToHave</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Transforms nondependent `let` expressions into `have` expressions.\nIf `e` is not type correct, returns `e`.\nThe `Meta.letToHave` trace class logs errors and messages.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/LetToHave.html#Lean.Meta.letToHave","kind":"def","line":435,"name":"Lean.Meta.letToHave","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Meta/LetToHave.lean#L435-L443"}}],"imports":["Init.Data.Range.Polymorphic.Iterators","Init.While","Lean.AddDecl","Lean.Meta.Check","Lean.Meta.Transform","Lean.ReservedNameAction","Lean.Util.CollectFVars","Lean.Util.CollectMVars"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.LetToHave"}